---
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
import { footerNav } from '../../data/footer.data';
---

<footer id="contacto" class="bg-coffee-dark pb-8 pt-16 text-white lg:pb-12 lg:pt-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 xl:px-0">
    <div class="mb-14 grid items-center gap-10 md:mb-20 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="space-y-4 md:space-y-6">
        <h2 class="misha-heading">
          Contamos con delivery en todo Chiclayo
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base text-white/70 sm:text-lg">
          Escríbenos por WhatsApp para coordinar tu pedido y recibirlo donde estés.
        </p>
        <Button
          href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=51978720665"
          size="lg"
          class="w-full rounded-xl sm:w-auto"
        >
          Contáctanos por WhatsApp
        </Button>
      </div>

      <div class="h-64 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 grayscale transition-all duration-700 hover:grayscale-0 sm:h-80 md:h-96">
        <img
          src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/7362966/pexels-photo-7362966.jpeg"
          alt="Repartidor preparando un pedido para delivery"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="mb-10 border-white/10 md:mb-12" />

    <div class="mb-10 grid gap-10 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2 lg:mb-12 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-12 text-center md:text-left">
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 justify-center md:justify-start">
          <img src="/misha.png" class="size-10" alt="" />
          <span class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.035em]">MISHA COFFE LAB</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-white/60">
          Café peruano de alta calidad, preparado con cercanía y detalle.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Navegación</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-white/75">
          {footerNav.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <a href={item.href} class="transition-colors hover:text-primary">{item.label}</a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Contacto</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-white/75">
          <li><a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=51978720665" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="transition-colors hover:text-primary">WhatsApp</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/mishacoffeelab/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="transition-colors hover:text-primary">Instagram</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/mishacoffeelab" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="transition-colors hover:text-primary">Facebook</a></li>
          <li><a href="/links" class="transition-colors hover:text-primary">Todos los enlaces</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Horario de atención</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-white/75">
          <li>Lun - Vie: 7:00am - 10:00pm</li>
          <li>Sáb: 7:00am - 10:00pm</li>
          <li>Dom: 7:00am - 10:00pm</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
